ow \\quad b = -8 + (-251) = -259. \\]\n\nAmong the values \\( 2009, 1006, 506, \\) and \\(-2009, -1006, -506,\\) and \\(-259, \\) the smallest positive value is \\( 506 \\).\n\nTherefore, the smallest positive integer \\( b \\) for which \\( x^2 + bx + 2008 \\) factors into a product of two binomials with integer coefficients is:\n\n\\[ \\boxed{506} \\]",
